MELPA milestone 1 offline fixture
=================================

This directory is a hand-built, version-1 MELPA archive used by the
offline `elpa-tests.el' suite.  It vendors the nine milestone target
packages as exact, unmodified upstream tarballs at pinned date versions,
plus an index that advertises exactly those versions.

