archive-contents
  A hand-built version-1 index (whose first element is 1) carrying
  exactly the nine entries above.  Every entry is `tar' kind at the
  pinned date version.  As MELPA does, the entries carry `:commit' and
  `:revdesc' extras; the client ignores extras.

Provenance
----------

The tarballs are unmodified copies of the files MELPA served at the
source URLs above; every URL answered HTTP 200 with the recorded byte
size on 2026-10-23.  They are redistributed here unmodified for
deterministic, network-free tests, with their embedded copyright and
license notices intact.  The total size is 634,880 bytes.

Each license above was read from the package's own source header.  The
index is hand-written for this fixture, not trimmed from a live index:
the fixture carries only the nine allowlisted targets, at the exact
versions named above.
